<title>USA: Canyon Resources says raises $10 mln.</title>
<headline>Canyon Resources says raises $10 mln.</headline>
<dateline>GOLDEN, Colo. 1997-06-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Canyon Resources Corp said Friday that NatWest Securities Ltd purchased 3.4 million shares of common stock of Canyon Resources for $9,987,500, or $2.93 per share.</p>
<p>The transaction is expected to close by June 11, 1997, Canyon said.</p>
<p>Canyon said it plans to use the money to move forward several mine development and advanced exploration projects in the United States.</p>
</text>
